{"id":"tabriz","name":"大不里士","en":"Tabriz","country":"Iran","lat":38.0882,"lng":46.2993,"dek":"高原上的风，丝绸之路上的一颗旧宝石","history":"大不里士因地处伊朗西北的古里河谷，扼守高加索、安纳托利亚与伊朗中部之间的通道，反复成为王朝首都或边陲重镇。它最早的可靠记载出现在公元前714年亚述国王萨尔贡二世的铭文中，名字写作Tarui或Tauris。萨珊王朝时期它也见于中古波斯语文献，称T'awrēš。","culture":"大不里士是波斯语与阿塞拜疆语交汇的城市。当地绝大多数居民为阿塞拜疆族，以阿塞拜疆语为日常语言，波斯语作为官方和教育媒介通行。城市长期位于伊朗与高加索、安纳托利亚之间，这种位置使它在语言、音乐、器具和日常习俗上带有明显的西北伊朗特点。","pull":"巴扎的屋顶下，布匹、铜器和地毯按着旧秩序排列","sights":[{"name":"大不里士市集区","orig":"بازار تبریز","intro":"中东最古老的巴扎之一，也是世界最大的有顶巴扎。市集至今仍是大不里士和伊朗西北部的核心商业空间，内部按商品分成多个巴扎切，其中地毯巴扎和黄金首饰巴扎最有名。2010年列入世界遗产。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Mozaffariyeh%2C_Grand_Bazzar_of_Tabriz%2C_IRAN.jpg/960px-Mozaffariyeh%2C_Grand_Bazzar_of_Tabriz%2C_IRAN.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%8D%E9%87%8C%E5%A3%AB%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%86%E5%8C%BA"},{"name":"蓝色清真寺","orig":"مسجد کبود","intro":"建于1465年，属于黑羊王朝时期。因外墙和内部大量使用蓝色瓷砖而得名。1778年大地震严重摧毁了建筑，现存主要为入口伊万和部分墙体。20世纪70年代修复时，部分缺失处改以彩绘替代原瓷砖。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/Blue_Mosque_%28Tabriz%29_General_view.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":613},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Mosque%2C_Tabriz"},{"name":"萨阿特塔","orig":"برج ساعت","intro":"大不里士的市标，位于市政广场旁，原为市政府主楼。如今底层设有城市历史图片与物品展，一层展示伊朗地毯。塔身带有卡扎尔晚期至巴列维早期公共建筑的样式。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Tabriz_Municipality_Sa%27at_Tower.jpg/960px-Tabriz_Municipality_Sa%27at_Tower.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":707},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sa'at_Tower"},{"name":"埃勒戈尔","orig":"ائل گلی","intro":"旧时统治者夏宫所在，现为城市东南的郊野公园。中央有一座人工湖，湖中小岛上设小厅，原为宫殿建筑，现已改造为餐饮场所。当地人多称它为Shah Goli。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Elg%C3%B6l%C3%BC_front.jpg/960px-Elg%C3%B6l%C3%BC_front.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":839},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El-G%C3%B6l%C3%BC"},{"name":"阿格城堡","orig":"ارگ علیشاه","intro":"原为大型清真寺建筑，始建于14世纪，后来被用作大不里士城堡和城墙的一部分。今天仅存一道高约28米的巨大砖墙，是城市在多次战乱和地震后遗留下来的显著轮廓。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Arg_Alishah4.JPG/960px-Arg_Alishah4.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arg_of_Tabriz"}],"foods":[{"name":"大不里士肉丸","orig":"کوفته تبریزی","intro":"伊朗西北部最具代表性的肉丸，以碎牛肉或羊肉、米、豌豆和香草制成，体型大，内部常藏有煮蛋或李子。传统做法需长时间焖煮，通常在节庆或家庭聚餐时上桌。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Koofteh_tabrizi.jpg/960px-Koofteh_tabrizi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"阿布古什特","orig":"آبگوشت","intro":"一种炖煮极久的肉汤，材料为羊肉、鹰嘴豆、白豆、土豆和番茄。食用时把汤滤出，用饼蘸汤，再把豆肉捣成糊状，与饼一起吃。大不里士传统餐厅常供应。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/Dizi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abgoosht"},{"name":"古拉比耶","orig":"قرابیه","intro":"一种以杏仁、蛋白和糖为主料的小圆甜饼，口感酥松。大不里士的传统甜食店多有自己的配方，常与茶一起食用。是当地干果和甜点文化中的经典之一。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Gurabija_%28%D0%B3%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B0%2CQurabiya%3B_Cuisine_of_Serbia%29.jpg/960px-Gurabija_%28%D0%B3%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B0%2CQurabiya%3B_Cuisine_of_Serbia%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghorayeba"},{"name":"杜格","orig":"دوغ","intro":"以酸奶、水、盐调制而成的传统冷饮，有时加入薄荷。餐厅中常搭配烤肉或米饭，超市里也有瓶装出售。大不里士的炎热夏季里，它是一种普遍的佐餐饮品。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Some_ayran_in_copper_cups.jpg/960px-Some_ayran_in_copper_cups.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":662},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%85%B0"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/Tabriz-16.PNG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":909},{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Tabriz_Aerial_View.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[46.168456,38.0395065],[46.1794852,38.0288251],[46.1840558,38.0221147],[46.1974668,38.0201537],[46.2131309,38.0226048],[46.218152,38.0265095],[46.2196218,38.030228],[46.2346163,38.0344071],[46.2426769,38.0405843],[46.2457332,38.0408629],[46.2516133,38.0396109],[46.2516551,38.0313822],[46.2757539,38.0307033],[46.2788779,38.0256318],[46.2873616,38.0250256],[46.291435,38.0157342],[46.3091814,38.0165406],[46.3074482,38.0235903],[46.3246445,38.0243761],[46.3333954,38.0261789],[46.3424057,38.0244718],[46.352012,38.0186867],[46.3540724,38.0189181],[46.3640077,38.0157958],[46.3715721,38.0155841],[46.3765722,38.0200236],[46.3904623,38.0266916],[46.390742,38.0283631],[46.4031662,38.0320156],[46.4126001,38.0443838],[46.3940277,38.053033],[46.3940383,38.055742],[46.4041785,38.0666723],[46.3899783,38.0735675],[46.3867235,38.0772002],[46.3792991,38.0816762],[46.3689136,38.0860337],[46.3374137,38.0916744],[46.3306331,38.093836],[46.3256549,38.0959976],[46.3203334,38.0997801],[46.3132094,38.1138953],[46.3094329,38.1163939],[46.3016223,38.1188924],[46.2938117,38.1228087],[46.2909793,38.1251045],[46.2865161,38.1259822],[46.2823104,38.1246318],[46.2798213,38.1252395],[46.2726115,38.1334765],[46.2680625,38.136852],[46.2290525,38.1486651],[46.2256761,38.1446998],[46.2115001,38.1534911],[46.2086677,38.1536598],[46.2042045,38.1492051],[46.1996126,38.1467076],[46.1966085,38.1433325],[46.2001276,38.1356368],[46.2178084,38.1226489],[46.2248897,38.1191962],[46.2248038,38.0984967],[46.2237811,38.0969127],[46.2187099,38.0965717],[46.2146759,38.0948154],[46.2121868,38.0910664],[46.2117147,38.0866417],[46.2164354,38.0854257],[46.2182378,38.086135],[46.2191391,38.0887697],[46.2225723,38.0901207],[46.2262446,38.0888311],[46.2286548,38.0783629],[46.2257657,38.0677344],[46.1940336,38.0476518],[46.168456,38.0395065]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","wiki":{"zh":"大不里士","en":"Tabriz","voyage":"Tabriz"}}}